<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 96/97 c/a deficit A$20.0 bln -govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 96/97 c/a deficit A$20.0 bln -govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said the government's forecast for the 1996/97 current account deficit was unchanged from the A$20.0 billion forecast in the August budget.</p>
<p>Costello issued the forecast as part of the government's regular mid-year review of budget projections.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
